<section id="contact" class="bg-slate-950 py-24 text-white"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-8"><div><p class="font-semibold text-blue-400">LET'S TALK</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-black">Ready to move your business to the cloud?</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-slate-400">Tell us what you need. We will help you choose the right email, backup or managed cloud solution.</p><div class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-slate-300"><p>✉ sales@cloudnova.example</p><p>☎ +91 90000 00000</p></div></div><form class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-7 text-slate-900 shadow-2xl" action="#" method="post"><div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><label>Name<input required name="name" placeholder="Your name"></label><label>Email<input required type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@company.com"></label><label>Phone<input name="phone" placeholder="+91"></label><label>Company<input name="company" placeholder="Company name"></label></div><label class="mt-5 block">Requirement<textarea name="message" rows="5" placeholder="Tell us about your requirement"></textarea></label><button class="mt-5 w-full rounded-xl bg-blue-600 px-5 py-3.5 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-blue-700">Send Enquiry</button></form></div></section>
